"""Builds labels/plan-drawings.json: a simplified, color-coded drawing for every
floor plan, traced by eye from each building's plan image (pending review).

Coordinates are in the source image's pixels (from the labeling contact sheets);
rectangles are [x1, y1, x2, y2]. Variants that share a layout (e.g. "Platinum",
A1 / A1.1 / A1.2) point at one drawing.
Run: python3 labels/make_drawings.py [site-data.json]  (site data records each plan's image URL)
"""
